      "https://eqlwiki.com/Classic_Planar_Armor:_Group_1",
      "https://eqlwiki.com/Classic_Planar_Armor:_Group_2"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Every set has 7 distinct piece names across 8 gear slots: the wrist piece is worn on both wrist slots, so its 'need' is 2.",
      "group_drops keys are armor-set 'group' (1 or 2). Chest/Hands/Feet/Wrist drop in the Plane of Fear; Arms/Head/Legs/Wrist drop in the Plane of Hate -- Wrist needs 2 and can come from either zone's mobs.",
      "universal_drops can drop any planar class's piece for the slot they hit, regardless of set/group."
    ]
  },
